sequenceDiagram
    actor Client as Redis Client
    participant Redis as Valkey 8.1
    participant Module as sd2-redis-module
    participant QE as QueryExecutor
    participant Store as InMemoryGraphStore

    Client->>Redis: GQL.QUERY social MATCH n RETURN n.name
    Redis->>Module: cmd_gql_query ctx args
    Module->>Module: catch_unwind panic safety
    Module->>Module: validate no write clauses
    Module->>QE: parse plan execute
    QE->>Store: find_all_nodes social
    Store-->>QE: node data
    QE-->>Module: QueryResult columns rows
    Module-->>Redis: RESP array
    Redis-->>Client: results
